   APEX-BLOCK UNIFORM FLOOR c_r (rigorous, finite-checked over bounded Q):
      c_2 = 66/91 = 0.725275   (minimizer Q=(1, 13))
      c_3 = 55/91 = 0.604396   (minimizer Q=(1, 12, 13))
      c_4 = 1979/4004 = 0.494256   (minimizer Q=(1, 11, 12, 13))
      c_5 = 2243/5880 = 0.381463   (minimizer Q=(1, 5, 7, 8, 9))
      c_6 = 3029/10780 = 0.280983   (minimizer Q=(1, 5, 7, 8, 9, 11))

====================================================================================================
