====================================================================================================
   minorant: C^infty, delta=0.05, int psi = h0 = 0.757143
      r=2 Q=(1, 13): meas(Qlon)=0.72527  minorant floor=0.57229  MAIN_Q=h0^2=0.57327  (floor>0: True, floor<=meas: True)
